{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-46","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-46-talk-403815172-line","text":"你跌跌撞撞地闯进一个熟悉的地方。你骤然抬头，看到她站在实验台前——她左手捧着绣面，右手拉起最后一根绣针上的线头，接着轻轻咬断它。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-46-talk-403815173-line","text":"「又闯进我的切片了。」阮•梅背对着你，声音不起波澜，「我还未完成作品的培育。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-46-talk-403815174-line","text":"接着，她迟疑几秒，回头看你…僵持几秒后，她叹了口气，从实验台走下来。糕点的清香扑鼻而来。「来了…就正好帮我瞅瞅。这几个图案哪个是『完美作品』？」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-46-talk-403815175-line","text":"「答对了…就有奖励。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-46-talk-403815180-line","text":"「拿奖励吧。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-46-text-16221379009688922682-choice","text":"信仰星神。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-46-text-13762000425722577616-effect","text":"强化全部祝福。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-46-text-2834603632119840838-choice","text":"更多与斯蒂芬作对的作弊机会。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-46-text-28010648042597466-choice","text":"偷拿点黑塔的好东西。","speaker":""}]}
